**Table 3: The status of our pull requests, proposing the removal of bloated dependencies (BD)**

| PR status | # of PRs | # of BD removed |
| --------- | -------: | --------------: |
| Merged    |       30 |              35 |
| Approved  |        1 |               1 |
| Rejected  |        1 |               1 |
